      "id": "o4ld4e5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bdr0igk",
      "content": "Basel Accords are international banking regulations issued by the Basel Committee on Banking Supervision (BCBS) to ensure banks hold enough capital to abGBOrb losses and reduce risk."
    },
